# Copy to .env when the stack is published behind a Cloudflare tunnel.
# Docker Compose reads .env automatically; `docker compose up -d` picks it up.
#
# These only change the links the portal shows (left rail) and the origin
# Grafana builds its redirects from — the tunnel's routes themselves are
# configured in Cloudflare, not here. See "Sharing it over a Cloudflare tunnel"
# in README.md.
#
# GRAFANA_URL=https://grafana.example.org
# PROMETHEUS_URL=https://prometheus.example.org
